{"version":1,"title":"分类：計算機組成原理 - SamuFlore","html":"<div class=\"l_main\" data-ui-surface=\"content\">\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"navbar top\"><div class=\"navbar-blur\"><div class=\"navbar-container\"><nav class=\"post\"><a href=\"/\">近期发布</a><a class=\"active\" href=\"/categories/\">分类：計算機組成原理</a><a href=\"/tags/\">标签</a><a href=\"/topic/\">专栏</a><a href=\"/archives/\">归档</a><a href=\"/recent/\">BAKER</a></nav></div></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"post-list post\"><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/2dab591c/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[BUAA CO P1]如何优雅地写 Testbench</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>学习自 ROIFE BLOG。</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-10-19T15:15:17.000Z\">2025-10-19</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 計算機組成原理</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/18246a69/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[BUAA CO P0]P0 上机之思考</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>今天非常惊险地通过了 P0 上机（实话说 P0 挂了就招笑了</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-10-13T13:14:40.000Z\">2025-10-13</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 計算機組成原理</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/11653afb/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[BUAA CO P0]关于 Mealy 机和 Moore 机的思考</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>完成 P0 课下内容后，我对 Logisim 中完成两种有限状态机的方法以及其区别有了一些见解。</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-10-05T09:24:33.000Z\">2025-10-05</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 計算機組成原理</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/1f9d902/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[BUAA CO Pre]MIPS 汇编入门</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>这是北京航空航天大学计算机学院 2025 年计算机组成原理预习部分的 MIPS 汇编部分。</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-09-20T08:00:25.000Z\">2025-09-20</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 計算機組成原理</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/c9f56abd/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[BUAA CO Pre]Verilog 入门</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>这是北京航空航天大学计算机学院 2025 年计算机组成原理预习部分的 Verilog 部分。</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-09-01T08:50:18.000Z\">2025-09-01</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 計算機組成原理</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/9707d4af/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[BUAA CO Pre]One-Hot 编码</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>独热编码（One-Hot Encoding），又称一位有效编码，是一种将分类变量转换为数值形式的常用方法。</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-08-19T14:06:21.000Z\">2025-08-19</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 計算機組成原理</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/e7ebcfa7/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[BUAA CO Pre]Logisim 入门</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>这是北京航空航天大学计算机学院 2025 年计算机组成原理预习部分的 Logisim 部分。</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-08-14T14:53:54.000Z\">2025-08-14</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 計算機組成原理</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div><div class=\"post-card-wrap\"><a class=\"post-card post card-hover card-hover--spotlight card-hover--tilt\" href=\"/posts/908cc5fb/\">\n<article class=\"md-text\"><h2 class=\"post-title\">[BUAA CO Pre]原码、反码与补码</h2><div class=\"excerpt\"><p>计组 Pre 开始了，但是我把上学期学的内容都忘了（</p></div><div class=\"meta cap\"><span class=\"cap preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:calendar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><time datetime=\"2025-08-13T16:10:54.000Z\">2025-08-14</time></span><span class=\"cap breadcrumb\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:category\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg><span>2025 - 2026 學年 / 計算機組成原理</span></span></div></article>\n</a></div></div>\n\n  <div class=\"paginator-wrap dis-select\">\n  <a class=\"extend prev\" rel=\"prev\" href=\"/categories/2025-2026-%E5%AD%B8%E5%B9%B4/%E8%A8%88%E7%AE%97%E6%A9%9F%E7%B5%84%E6%88%90%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86/\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:arrow-left\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg></a><a class=\"page-number\" href=\"/categories/2025-2026-%E5%AD%B8%E5%B9%B4/%E8%A8%88%E7%AE%97%E6%A9%9F%E7%B5%84%E6%88%90%E5%8E%9F%E7%90%86/\">1</a><span class=\"page-number current\">2</span><span class=\"extend next\" rel=\"next\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-icon=\"default:arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></svg></span>\n  </div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>","bodyClass":"index